# postmarketos-mkinitfs ships /etc/mdev.conf into the initramfs but not the
# helper scripts that the config calls out to. Eight rules in mdev.conf point
# at /lib/mdev/persistent-storage, including the one for mmcblk.*, so without
# this the helper fails on every block device event and /dev/disk/by-partlabel
# is never populated.
#
# mount_subpartitions() in init_functions.sh looks for
# /dev/disk/by-partlabel/userdata first and only falls back to scanning every
# partition with fdisk, which does not finish inside its 10 second budget on
# this board. The boot then drops to the debug shell with
# "ERROR: failed to mount subpartitions!".
/lib/mdev/persistent-storage
